    "Name": "Whitworth WTH-CO",
    "Details": "A Rimcommonality Custom Field refit, This Withworth has kept its Design of being a Frontline Brawler, but now with a Different assortment of Weapons. Some of the upgrades were Gifts, others have been picked off of Mechs that dont need them anymore. There is even a EWAR Package, but its nothing to write Home about. You definitively do not want to walk into Pulse Laser Range. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "Whitworth"
  },
